{
  "id": "dsa-2745",
  "title": "HTML body Tag - GeeksforGeeks",
  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The &lt;body&gt; tag in HTML defines the main content of a </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3142\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>web page</span></a><span> and is always placed within the </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3143\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>&lt;html&gt; tag </span></a><span>as its last child. It contains everything that is visible on the page, including </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3144\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>headings,</span></a><span> </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3145\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>paragraphs,</span></a><span> </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3146\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>images,</span></a><span> </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3147\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>links, </span></a><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-2751\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>tables,</span></a><span> and </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3148\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>lists.</span></a></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-2745\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>&lt;body&gt; tag </span></a><span>is required in every HTML document.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>If omitted, most </span><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3149\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>browsers </span></a><span>will still render the content as if the tag were present, but it’s not considered good practice.</span></li></ul><h3 id=\"syntax\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Syntax</span></h3><pre><span>&lt;body&gt;  Body Contents... &lt;/body&gt;</span></pre><h3 id=\"html-body-structure\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>HTML Body Structure</span></h3><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">index.html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span> <span class=\"na\">lang</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"en\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>GeeksforGeeks<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>This is paragraph text<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><h2 id=\"attributes\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Attributes</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> There are many attributes in the &lt;body&gt; tag that are depreciated from HTML5 are listed below:&nbsp;</span></p><table><thead><tr><th style=\"width: 40%;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>Attribute Values</span></p></th><th style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>Description</span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3150\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>background</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It contains the URL of the background image. It is used to set the background image.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3151\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>bgcolor</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It is used to specify the background color of an image.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3152\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>alink</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It is used to specify the color of the active link.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3147\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>link</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It is used to specify the color of visited links.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3153\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>text</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It specifies the color of the text in a document.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 40%; text-align: center;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-3154\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span>vlink</span></a></p></td><td style=\"width: 350px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It specifies the color of visited links.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"body-tag-with-css-implementation\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Body tag with CSS implementation</span></h3><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">index.html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span> <span class=\"na\">lang</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"en\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span> <span class=\"na\">style</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"background-color:seagreen\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>HTML body Tag<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h3</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        This is paragraph Tag and it's background-color is seagreen.\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><h3 id=\"html-body-tag-example-with-hyperlink\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>HTML </span><code><span>&lt;body&gt;</span></code><span> Tag Example with Hyperlink</span></h3><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"false\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">index.html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>HTML LINKS<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Welcome To GFG<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">a</span> <span class=\"na\">href</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/community/\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>GFG Community<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">a</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Output:</strong></b></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"output\" height=\"101\" src=\"./images/dsa-2745-img-1.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250606144218798212/Screenshot-2025-06-06-at-14-41-18-HTML-LINKS.png 361w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250606144218798212/Screenshot-2025-06-06-at-14-41-18-HTML-LINKS-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250606144218798212/Screenshot-2025-06-06-at-14-41-18-HTML-LINKS-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250606144218798212/Screenshot-2025-06-06-at-14-41-18-HTML-LINKS-300.png 300w\" width=\"361\"><figcaption>output</figcaption></figure><h3 id=\"html-body-tag-with-text-color-attribute\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>HTML </span><code><span>&lt;body&gt;</span></code><span> Tag with Text Color Attribute</span></h3><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">index.html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>GFG color<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">title</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span> <span class=\"na\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"green\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Welcome To GFG<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Body Text color changed to green.<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs></div>",
  "textContent": "The <body> tag in HTML defines the main content of a web page and is always placed within the <html> tag as its last child. It contains everything that is visible on the page, including headings, paragraphs, images, links, tables, and lists.The <body> tag is required in every HTML document.If omitted, most browsers will still render the content as if the tag were present, but it’s not considered good practice.Syntax<body>  Body Contents... </body>HTML Body Structure\n            index.html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<body>\n    <h3>GeeksforGeeks</h3>\n    <p>This is paragraph text</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nAttributes There are many attributes in the <body> tag that are depreciated from HTML5 are listed below: Attribute ValuesDescriptionbackgroundIt contains the URL of the background image. It is used to set the background image.bgcolorIt is used to specify the background color of an image.alinkIt is used to specify the color of the active link.linkIt is used to specify the color of visited links.textIt specifies the color of the text in a document.vlinkIt specifies the color of visited links.Body tag with CSS implementation\n            index.html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<body style=\"background-color:seagreen\">\n    <h3>HTML body Tag</h3>\n    <p>\n        This is paragraph Tag and it's background-color is seagreen.\n    </p>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nHTML <body> Tag Example with Hyperlink\n            index.html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<title>HTML LINKS</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<h2>Welcome To GFG</h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/community/\">GFG Community</a>\n</body>\n</html>\n\nOutput:outputHTML <body> Tag with Text Color Attribute\n            index.html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<title>GFG color</title>\n</head>\n<body text=\"green\">\n<h2>Welcome To GFG</h2>\n<p>Body Text color changed to green.</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "url": "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/html/html-body-tag"
}
